      "content": "That's a bit vague for a formal proposal. I need to be able to defend a specific direction to the council. \n\nIf you had to choose just one as the primary \"gold standard\" for equity, which would it be? I'm looking for the one that actually achieves true equity, rather than just a compromise.",
